{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51809","headline":"题庐山瀑布 · 陆蟾","name":"题庐山瀑布","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正源人莫测，千尺挂云端。\n岳色染不得，神功裁亦难。\n夏喷猿鸟浴，秋射斗牛寒。\n流到沧溟日，翻涛更好看。\n〖2〗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}